  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    height = len(grid)\n    width = len(grid[0])\n    out = [[0] * width for _ in range(height)]\n    for r in range(height):\n        for c in range(width):\n            if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                out[r][c] = grid[r][c]\n            if r < width and c < height and grid[c][r] != 0:\n                out[r][c] = grid[c][r]\n    return out\n```",
